    {
      "id": "4451a2eb-ba3d-4816-b2fe-f924955f166e",
      "name": "Note: Endpoint",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -700,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Lead Scoring API\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/lead-score (test: /webhook-test/lead-score)\n**Content-Type:** application/json\n\n**Body fields**\n- name (string)\n- email (string, REQUIRED)\n- company (string)\n- website (string)\n- budget (string or number)\n- message (string, REQUIRED)\n\n**Flow:** validate input -> AI scoring with structured output -> log to Google Sheet \"Lead Scores\" -> JSON response.\n**Responses:** 200 scored lead, 400 when email or message is missing.\nSetup: connect OpenAI and Google Sheets credentials, and pick the \"Lead Scores\" spreadsheet (header row: timestamp, status, name, email, company, website, budget, message, score, category, intent_summary, suggested_next_action, error).",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad1a2ea6-d4db-4ac0-abb2-b2e37d0d5e27",
      "name": "Note: Sample Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sample request\ncurl -X POST https://YOUR-N8N-HOST/webhook/lead-score \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n  \"name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"jane@acme.com\",\n  \"company\": \"Acme Inc\",\n  \"website\": \"https://acme.com\",\n  \"budget\": \"$20,000\",\n  \"message\": \"We need a CRM integration live by next month.\"\n}'",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 340
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "20bc506f-6a05-4643-bde3-1f0cf4200ac6",
      "name": "Note: Sample Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        380,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sample responses\n**200 OK**\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"lead\": { \"name\": \"Jane Doe\", \"email\": \"jane@acme.com\", \"company\": \"Acme Inc\" },\n  \"score\": 82,\n  \"category\": \"hot\",\n  \"intent_summary\": \"Wants a CRM integration live within a month with a defined budget.\",\n  \"suggested_next_action\": \"Book a discovery call within 24 hours.\"\n}\n\n**400 Bad Request**\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": \"Validation failed\",\n  \"details\": \"Missing required field(s): email\"\n}",
        "color": 6,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 420
      }
    }
